 " to ",
 StyleBox["radio, television",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 ", the drawn path is just reporting that shift."
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{3, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellMargins->{{60, 60}, {8, 12}},
 CellFrameColor->RGBColor[0.35, 0.6, 0.4],
 FontSize->12,
